cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this work, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "ESP32-simple_http_server: a simple HTTP server for UART messages"
abstract: "An ESP32 program that joins a Wi-Fi network and serves, over HTTP, the last message received on its UART. Written in C with ESP-IDF and FreeRTOS, in VS Code with PlatformIO, at the Universidade de Brasília with Prof. Jones Yudi Mori Alves da Silva."
authors:
